Package: dockermigrate
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: docker.io | docker-ce
Maintainer: Pulsar OS Team <team@pulsaros.io>
Description: Docker container migration tool with web UI
 Export and import Docker containers, volumes, and compose projects
 between machines. Provides a web interface on port 8070 for
 selecting containers and managing backups.
